#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:534
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The shortcuts mentioned below for switching components vary slightly "
"depending on the components you have activated (see <xref linkend=\"main-"
"config\"/>). In general, the components can be activated by using "
"<keycap>Ctrl</keycap> in conjunction with a number; the number can be "
"determined by counting how many items from the top the component is in the "
"side pane."
msgstr ""

